cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Regressleuth in research, please cite it as below."
title: "Regressleuth: budgeted counterfactual replay for ML regression diagnosis"
type: software
version: 0.1.0a1
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: Mishra
    given-names: Avdhesh
abstract: >-
  Regressleuth isolates which versioned ML pipeline components, singly or as a pair
  interaction, reproduce a measured regression, using budgeted adaptive counterfactual
  replay with noise-aware judgement and a monotonicity audit.
keywords:
  - machine learning
  - debugging
  - root cause analysis
  - delta debugging
  - MLOps
